{"sectionId":"organic_rxn/carbonyl","items":[{"id":"organic_rxn--carbonyl-k001","sectionId":"organic_rxn/carbonyl","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"carbonyl 탄소는 O와의 극성 결합 때문에 친전자성이 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--carbonyl-k002","sectionId":"organic_rxn/carbonyl","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"aldehyde는 일반적으로 ketone보다","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--carbonyl-k003","sectionId":"organic_rxn/carbonyl","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"입체장애와 전자공여 효과가 작아 친핵성 첨가에 더 반응적이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--carbonyl-k004","sectionId":"organic_rxn/carbonyl","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"hydride 환원은 aldehyde→1차 alcohol, ketone→2차 alcohol이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--carbonyl-k005","sectionId":"organic_rxn/carbonyl","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"Grignard 시약 RMgX는 carbonyl 탄소에 탄소 친핵체로 공격하고 산성 후처리로 alcohol을 생성한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--carbonyl-k006","sectionId":"organic_rxn/carbonyl","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"formaldehyde는 1차, 다른 aldehyde는 2차, ketone은 3차 alcohol을 주는 전형적 경로다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--carbonyl-k007","sectionId":"organic_rxn/carbonyl","uni